  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "2202135a-b13d-42c9-9d1a-f9a96014ad75"],
 " is an operator selector. ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"Einstoff", "[", 
   StyleBox["operator", "TI"], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "ab38e2a6-3d87-409d-8c71-eb35bdabcf00"],
 " returns the curried interface for that operation; the returned function \
accepts a shape description, a list of tensors, an optional list of axis-size \
bindings, and options."
}], "Notes",
