 " or ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["logsoftmax",
    FontSlant->"Italic"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "3371acd9-7ab2-4136-9074-7e14ce207d87"],
 ". Parameterized operations can be supplied directly as functions, for \
example ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    TagBox[
     ButtonBox[
